msgstr "पोइन्ट:"

#: lskatview.cpp:701
msgid "Won:"
msgstr "बिजयी:"

#: lskatview.cpp:706
msgid "Games:"
msgstr "खेल:"

#: lskatview.cpp:838
msgid "Hold on... the other player hasn't been yet..."
msgstr "होल्ड गर्नुहोस्... अहिलेसम्म अर्को खेलाडी छैन..."

#: lskatview.cpp:841
msgid "Hold your horses..."
msgstr "तपाईँका घोडा होल्ड गर्नुहोस्..."

#: lskatview.cpp:844
msgid "Ah ah ah... only one go at a time..."
msgstr "अह...एक समयमा एउटा मात्र जान्छ..."

#: lskatview.cpp:847
msgid "Please wait... it is not your turn."
msgstr "कृपया प्रतिक्षा गर्नुहोस्... यो तपाईँको पालो होइन ।"

